violence 2 (SceneRadar: A giant fish chases a submarine - but is eaten by a bigger fish.)

0:20:00.00 --> 0:20:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A monster chases a submarine. Another monster grabs it.)

0:22:45.00 --> 0:23:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Jedis attack and slash down droids. They then rescue the queen.)

0:24:40.00 --> 0:26:45.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Jedis slash and destroy droids. The two sides exchange fire. The group escapes in a ship. Other spaceships attack and damage the ship.)

