sex word 1 (naked, AI flag)

1:00:45.00 --> 1:09:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a race on a desert planet. The contestants ram into each other, fire at each other and cause many explosions.)

1:16:50.00 --> 1:17:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A Sith lord attacks a Jedi. After a brief fight, the Jedi escapes.)

1:46:00.00 --> 2:04:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Battle sequence. Tanks and droids attack the Jedi group. The Jedis fight back - slashing and destroying many droids. We see a dogfight in space. The droid army charges at the Gungan army - and a battle begins. We see many explosions and casualties. The Jedis fight with the Sith lord. Anakin pilots a spacecraft. The Jedi gets stabbed and killed by the Sith lord. Anakin destroys the space hanger and consequently the droid army. With the droid army non functional - the battle is over.)

2:04:05.00 --> 2:04:30.00
violence 3 (SceneRadar: A Jedi slashes the Sith lord into two halves.)

2:07:30.00 --> 2:08:15.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: We see a funeral for the fallen Jedi.)
